    {'file': 'part-5-retrieval-conversation/module-21-conversational-ai/section-21.4.html', 'svg_idx': 1, 'caption': 'Figure 21.4.2: Fallback strategy hierarchy from least disruptive (clarification) to most disruptive (human handoff). Systems should exhaust lower levels before escalating.', 'svg_text': 'L1 Clarification Question "Did you mean X or Y?" L2 Rephrasing Request "Could you rephrase that? I want to help but I am not sure what you need." L3 Capability Redirect "I can help with A, B, or C. Which is closest to what you need?" L4 Graceful Acknowledgment "I do not have that information, but he', 'svg_start': 27796, 'svg_end': 32969},
